items.source:
This marker interface is used on classes to mark that they represent additional
relationship properties. A class that implements this interface must not be used as a
or annotated with <a href="Node.html" title="annotation interface in org.springframework.data.neo4j.core.schema"><code>Node</code></a>. It must however have exactly one field of type `Long`
annotated with `@Id @GeneratedValue` such as this:

<pre>@RelationshipProperties
public class Roles {

        @Id @GeneratedValue
private Long id;

@TargetNode
private final Person person;

// Your properties
}
</pre>

items.translation:
该标记接口用于在类上标记它们表示额外的关系属性。实现此接口的类不得用作或带有 <a href="Node.html" title="org.springframework.data.neo4j.core.schema 中的注解接口"><code>Node</code></a> 注解。然而，它必须恰好有一个类型为 `Long` 的字段，并带有 `@Id @GeneratedValue` 注解，如下所示：

<pre>@RelationshipProperties
public class Roles {

        @Id @GeneratedValue
private Long id;

@TargetNode
private final Person person;

// 您的属性
}
</pre>
